prompt.template:
Fetch execution traces from the Activity API.

Endpoint: POST /v2/impulses/resolve
Payload:
```json
{
  "pointer": {
    "type": "activityExecutionTrace",
    "query": {
      "limit": {{limit}},
      "status": "{{status_filter}}",
      "orderBy": "started_at DESC"
    }
  }
}
```

Use curl or fetch to query: $ACTIVITY_API_ENDPOINT/v2/impulses/resolve

Transform the response into dashboard format:
```json
{
  "shape": "trace_list",
  "timestamp": "<now>",
  "traces": [
    {
      "id": "<execution_id>",
      "template": "<template_id>",
      "status": "completed|failed",
      "duration_ms": <number>,
      "cost_usd": <number>,
      "started_at": "<ISO date>"
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "total": <count>,
    "completed": <count>,
    "failed": <count>,
    "avg_duration_ms": <number>
  }
}
```

Output to: /tmp/dashboard/trace-list.json
